Lebai LM3 with gripper model

Source: https://github.com/lebai-robotics/lebai-ros-sdk
Revision: f1f13b6849f34f61dce0483e09f531816d292b63 (ROS 2 Jazzy)
Upstream license: Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

Derived materials in this directory were modified for the VR4Arm experiments.
The Xacro was expanded into URDF, gripper meshes were converted from COLLADA
to STL, and a large collision STL was also converted to OBJ. The physical model
was converted into MJCF with a fixed gripper, six position actuators, inertia
and collision configuration, damping, armature and gravity. The compensated
variant additionally sets each body's gravity compensation to one.
